  "provenance": [
   "patch 0x39/0x4d (hintHndl reload placement): toolchain-diff \u2014 FA loads hintHndl a 2nd time late (@0x4c, between f3-load and 03 ea); our CL 10.20.6166 always hoists the 2nd load early after 2b d1. 11 source variants (volatile, hoist-var, post-access, ptr-fusion forms: build/probe/pads/lrsweep.py) all byte-identical CL code; 20 flag sets (lrflags.py): artifacts exist ONLY under /G5-family; no-/G5 builds lack both artifacts but differ structurally (register assignment 8d 0c 92 + [ecx+0x17] base, not FA's [ebp+eax] sib); TU context (neighbor pressure, #pragma optimize) has no effect. FA's shape is a G5-scheduler revision diff.",
   "patch 0x44/0x4a (fused f3 sib vs materialized addr): toolchain-diff \u2014 FA materializes the f3 address (8d 4c 05 00 lea ecx,[ebp+eax] + 8b 69 1f); our CL fuses to sib 8b 6c 05 1f under every source form and /G5 flag; struct-with-declared-offsets is impossible (FA field offsets 0x17/0x1b/0x1f are not 4-aligned). Same revision evidence as 0x39."
  ]
 },
